{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a theme block called "Comparison table".
    
    Layout (desktop): two areas side by side. On the left (about 35%), a centered text area, vertically centered: a bold heading (size 32px, line height 1.15, color #111111, centered) and under it a short paragraph (size 16px, line height 1.5, color #111111, centered). On the right (about 65%), the comparison grid.
    
    The comparison grid has 4 columns and up to 7 rows:
    - Column 0 (row labels): light gray cards (#f6f6f6), bold text 15px, left aligned, padding 10px 12px, each row separated by a 1px line (#ececec). The first and last label cells have rounded outer corners (12px).
    - Column 1 (highlighted brand column): a tall dark column. The header cell shows the brand name or a logo image (centered, white text/logo). Below, 7 cells with a brown gradient going from very dark (#2b211d) at the top to light taupe (#ac9d8c) at the bottom (each row a slightly lighter shade, like a stepped gradient). Each cell shows a white circled check icon (an outlined circle with a small check, 22px). The whole column has rounded corners 14px and a small gap (8px) from the next column.
    - Column 2 and 3 (competitors): a light gray column (#e0e0e0 header, then cells fading from #e8e8e8 at the top to #fafafa at the bottom). The header shows the competitor name (bold, 13px, centered, max 2 lines). Each cell shows either a black circle with a white X (22px) for "no", or a brown (#8c7a62) circle with a white check for "yes". Rounded corners 14px, 8px gap between columns.
    
    All 4 columns have the same row height (64px on desktop) so rows line up across the grid. The header row is 96px high.
    
    Mobile: stack the text area above the grid. Keep the 4 columns, reduce the row height to 56px, text to 13px, the row-label column to 36% width, and make the icons 18px.
    
    Editable settings:
    1. Heading (text)
    2. Paragraph (text)
    3. Brand header: text (default empty) and Brand logo (image picker, optional)
    4. Competitor 1 name (text)
    5. Competitor 2 name (text)
    6. Rows: use 7 groups of fields. For each row: Row label (text), Brand column (checkbox yes/no, default yes), Competitor 1 (select: Yes / No), Competitor 2 (select: Yes / No). Hide a row if its label is empty.
    7. Brand column top color (color, default #2b211d) and bottom color (color, default #ac9d8c)
    8. Competitor column color (color, default #e8e8e8)
    9. "Yes" icon color for competitors (color, default #8c7a62)
    10. Text color (color, default #111111)
    11. Row label card background (color, default #f6f6f6)
    12. Row height desktop (range 48 to 96, default 64)
    13. Corner radius (range 0 to 24, default 14)
    
    Use CSS grid, keep the code short, no external libraries. Use inline SVG for the icons., Create a theme block called "Comparison table".
    
    Desktop layout: two areas side by side. Left (35%): centered text, vertically centered: a bold heading (32px, line height 1.15, #111111) and a paragraph below (16px, line height 1.5, #111111). Right (65%): a grid with 4 columns and up to 7 rows.
    
    Grid:
    - Column 0: row labels. Light gray cards (#f6f6f6), bold 15px text, left aligned, padding 10px 12px, 1px separators (#ececec). Round the outer corners of the first and last label (12px).
    - Column 1 (highlighted): a tall dark column, rounded 14px. The header shows the brand name (white, centered, letter-spaced) or a logo image. Cells go from very dark brown (#2b211d) at the top to light taupe (#ac9d8c) at the bottom, one shade lighter per row. Each cell shows a white circle with a small check (22px).
    - Columns 2 and 3: light gray (#e0e0e0 header, cells fading from #e8e8e8 to #fafafa). Header: competitor name, bold 13px, centered. Each cell shows a black circle with a white X ("no") or a brown (#8c7a62) circle with a white check ("yes").
    
    All columns have the same row height (64px), header height 96px, 8px gap between columns. Mobile: stack the text above the grid, row height 56px, text 13px, label column 36% wide, icons 18px.
    
    Settings: heading, paragraph, brand name, brand logo (image), competitor 1 name, competitor 2 name, and for each of 7 rows: label (text), brand (checkbox, default on), competitor 1 (Yes/No), competitor 2 (Yes/No). Hide a row if its label is empty. Colors: brand column top/bottom, competitor column, competitor "yes" icon, text, label background. Row height and corner radius.
    
    Use CSS grid and inline SVG icons. Keep the code short.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% liquid
  assign row_count = 0
  for i in (1..7)
    assign label_key = 'row_' | append: i | append: '_label'
    if block.settings[label_key] != blank
      assign row_count = row_count | plus: 1
    endif
  endfor
%}
{% style %}
  .ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;max-width:100%;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }}}
  .ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:35fr 65fr;gap:24px;align-items:stretch}
  .ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;text-align:center;padding:20px}
  .ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro h2{font-size:32px;line-height:1.15;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 16px;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }}}
  .ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro p{font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin:0;color:{{ block.settings.text_color }}}
  .ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:8px;min-width:0}
  .ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__column{display:grid;grid-template-rows:96px repeat({{ row_count }},{{ block.settings.row_height }}px);gap:1px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:{{ block.settings.corner_radius }}px;min-width:0}
  .ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cell{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;padding:8px;min-width:0}
  .ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__label{justify-content:flex-start;text-align:left;background:{{ block.settings.label_background }};font-size:15px;font-weight:700;padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #ececec}
  .ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__labels{border-radius:12px}
  .ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__labels .ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__label:first-child{border-radius:12px 12px 0 0}
  .ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__labels .ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__label:last-child{border-radius:0 0 12px 12px}
  .ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__brand{background:linear-gradient(to bottom,{{ block.settings.brand_top_color }},{{ block.settings.brand_bottom_color }});color:#fff}
  .ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__brand .ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cell:first-child{background:{{ block.settings.brand_top_color }};letter-spacing:.12em}
  .ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__competitor{background:linear-gradient(to bottom,{{ block.settings.competitor_color }},#fafafa)}
  .ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__competitor .ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cell:first-child{background:#e0e0e0}
  .ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head{font-size:13px;line-height:1.25;font-weight:700;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  .ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head img{max-width:100%;max-height:54px;object-fit:contain}
  .ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon{width:22px;height:22px;display:block;flex:none}
  @media(max-width:749px){.ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__layout{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:20px}.ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro{padding:8px}.ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro h2{font-size:26px}.ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro p{font-size:13px}.ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid{grid-template-columns:36% repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:4px}.ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__column{grid-template-rows:96px repeat({{ row_count }},56px)}.ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cell{padding:4px}.ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__label{font-size:13px;padding:6px}.ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon{width:18px;height:18px}}
{% endstyle %}
<div class="ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__layout">
    <div class="ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__intro">{% if block.settings.heading != blank %}<h2>{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>{% endif %}{% if block.settings.paragraph != blank %}<p>{{ block.settings.paragraph | escape }}</p>{% endif %}</div>
    <div class="ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__grid">
      <div class="ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__column ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__labels"><div class="ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cell ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__label"></div>{% for i in (1..7) %}{% assign label_key = 'row_' | append: i | append: '_label' %}{% if block.settings[label_key] != blank %}<div class="ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cell ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__label">{{ block.settings[label_key] | escape }}</div>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
      <div class="ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__column ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__brand"><div class="ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cell ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head">{% if block.settings.brand_logo %}<img src="{{ block.settings.brand_logo | image_url: width: 300 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.brand_logo.alt | escape }}">{% else %}{{ block.settings.brand_name | escape }}{% endif %}</div>{% for i in (1..7) %}{% assign label_key = 'row_' | append: i | append: '_label' %}{% assign yes_key = 'row_' | append: i | append: '_brand_yes' %}{% if block.settings[label_key] != blank %}<div class="ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cell">{% if block.settings[yes_key] %}<svg class="ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" role="img" aria-label="Yes"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"/><path d="m7 12 3.2 3.2L17.5 8" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>{% else %}<svg class="ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" role="img" aria-label="No"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"/><path d="m8 8 8 8m0-8-8 8" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>{% endif %}</div>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
      {% for competitor in (1..2) %}<div class="ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__column ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__competitor"><div class="ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cell ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head">{% assign name_key = 'competitor_' | append: competitor | append: '_name' %}{{ block.settings[name_key] | escape }}</div>{% for i in (1..7) %}{% assign label_key = 'row_' | append: i | append: '_label' %}{% assign yes_key = 'row_' | append: i | append: '_competitor_' | append: competitor %}{% if block.settings[label_key] != blank %}<div class="ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cell">{% if block.settings[yes_key] == 'yes' %}<svg class="ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" role="img" aria-label="Yes"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="{{ block.settings.yes_icon_color }}"/><path d="m7 12 3.2 3.2L17.5 8" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>{% else %}<svg class="ai-compare-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" role="img" aria-label="No"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#111"/><path d="m8 8 8 8m0-8-8 8" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>{% endif %}</div>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
{% schema %}
{"name":"Comparison table","tag":null,"class":"comparison-table-block","settings":[{"type":"text","id":"heading","label":"Heading","default":"How we compare"},{"type":"text","id":"paragraph","label":"Paragraph","default":"See what makes our approach different."},{"type":"text","id":"brand_name","label":"Brand name"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"brand_logo","label":"Brand logo"},{"type":"text","id":"competitor_1_name","label":"Competitor 1 name","default":"Competitor 1"},{"type":"text","id":"competitor_2_name","label":"Competitor 2 name","default":"Competitor 2"},{"type":"header","content":"Rows"},{"type":"text","id":"row_1_label","label":"Row 1 label","default":"Feature one"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"row_1_brand_yes","label":"Brand: row 1 yes","default":true},{"type":"select","id":"row_1_competitor_1","label":"Competitor 1: row 1","options":[{"value":"yes","label":"Yes"},{"value":"no","label":"No"}],"default":"no"},{"type":"select","id":"row_1_competitor_2","label":"Competitor 2: row 1","options":[{"value":"yes","label":"Yes"},{"value":"no","label":"No"}],"default":"no"},{"type":"text","id":"row_2_label","label":"Row 2 label","default":"Feature two"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"row_2_brand_yes","label":"Brand: row 2 yes","default":true},{"type":"select","id":"row_2_competitor_1","label":"Competitor 1: row 2","options":[{"value":"yes","label":"Yes"},{"value":"no","label":"No"}],"default":"no"},{"type":"select","id":"row_2_competitor_2","label":"Competitor 2: row 2","options":[{"value":"yes","label":"Yes"},{"value":"no","label":"No"}],"default":"no"},{"type":"text","id":"row_3_label","label":"Row 3 label"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"row_3_brand_yes","label":"Brand: row 3 yes","default":true},{"type":"select","id":"row_3_competitor_1","label":"Competitor 1: row 3","options":[{"value":"yes","label":"Yes"},{"value":"no","label":"No"}],"default":"no"},{"type":"select","id":"row_3_competitor_2","label":"Competitor 2: row 3","options":[{"value":"yes","label":"Yes"},{"value":"no","label":"No"}],"default":"no"},{"type":"text","id":"row_4_label","label":"Row 4 label"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"row_4_brand_yes","label":"Brand: row 4 yes","default":true},{"type":"select","id":"row_4_competitor_1","label":"Competitor 1: row 4","options":[{"value":"yes","label":"Yes"},{"value":"no","label":"No"}],"default":"no"},{"type":"select","id":"row_4_competitor_2","label":"Competitor 2: row 4","options":[{"value":"yes","label":"Yes"},{"value":"no","label":"No"}],"default":"no"},{"type":"text","id":"row_5_label","label":"Row 5 label"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"row_5_brand_yes","label":"Brand: row 5 yes","default":true},{"type":"select","id":"row_5_competitor_1","label":"Competitor 1: row 5","options":[{"value":"yes","label":"Yes"},{"value":"no","label":"No"}],"default":"no"},{"type":"select","id":"row_5_competitor_2","label":"Competitor 2: row 5","options":[{"value":"yes","label":"Yes"},{"value":"no","label":"No"}],"default":"no"},{"type":"text","id":"row_6_label","label":"Row 6 label"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"row_6_brand_yes","label":"Brand: row 6 yes","default":true},{"type":"select","id":"row_6_competitor_1","label":"Competitor 1: row 6","options":[{"value":"yes","label":"Yes"},{"value":"no","label":"No"}],"default":"no"},{"type":"select","id":"row_6_competitor_2","label":"Competitor 2: row 6","options":[{"value":"yes","label":"Yes"},{"value":"no","label":"No"}],"default":"no"},{"type":"text","id":"row_7_label","label":"Row 7 label"},{"type":"checkbox","id":"row_7_brand_yes","label":"Brand: row 7 yes","default":true},{"type":"select","id":"row_7_competitor_1","label":"Competitor 1: row 7","options":[{"value":"yes","label":"Yes"},{"value":"no","label":"No"}],"default":"no"},{"type":"select","id":"row_7_competitor_2","label":"Competitor 2: row 7","options":[{"value":"yes","label":"Yes"},{"value":"no","label":"No"}],"default":"no"},{"type":"header","content":"Colors and sizing"},{"type":"color","id":"brand_top_color","label":"Brand top color","default":"#2b211d"},{"type":"color","id":"brand_bottom_color","label":"Brand bottom color","default":"#ac9d8c"},{"type":"color","id":"competitor_color","label":"Competitor column color","default":"#e8e8e8"},{"type":"color","id":"yes_icon_color","label":"Yes icon color","default":"#8c7a62"},{"type":"color","id":"text_color","label":"Text color","default":"#111111"},{"type":"color","id":"label_background","label":"Row label background","default":"#f6f6f6"},{"type":"range","id":"row_height","label":"Row height desktop","min":48,"max":96,"step":4,"unit":"px","default":64},{"type":"range","id":"corner_radius","label":"Corner radius","min":0,"max":24,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":14},{"type":"range","id":"desktop_width_percent","label":"Desktop width","min":50,"max":100,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":100}],"presets":[{"name":"Comparison table"}]}{% endschema %}